    "text": "IT is hereby notified under regulation 30 of the Wages Boards Regulations, that Mr. Chandana Wijayanama has beenappointed as Employer\u2019s Representative and Mr. W. U. Priyasantha has been appointed employee\u2019s representative of theWages Board for the Dock, Harbour and Port Transport Trade in place of Mr. Deshan Dewasagayam and Mr. P. D. NimalKarunathilake by the Hon. Minister of Labour under Section 9 of the Wages Board Ordinance (Chapter 136). This appointmentis valid only up to 14.08.2016.",
